#. event 0, page 1 | screen 128, cell (8,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e000/p1/t00"
msgid "美広　：テレビ局？　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　どうしてテレビ局がこんな所に？"
msgstr "Bihiro: A TV station? What's a TV station doing out here?"

#. event 0, page 1 | screen 128, cell (8,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e000/p1/t01"
msgid "青木　：あぁ、アレだろ、アレ・・・・確か　　　　「霊撮隊（れいさつたい）」とか　　　　　いう特別番組の・・・"
msgstr "Aoki: Oh, it's that, you know.... that special program, the \"Ghost-Filming Crew\" or whatever it's called..."

#. event 0, page 1 | screen 128, cell (8,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e000/p1/t02"
msgid "千歳　：「霊撮隊」！？　毎年、夏に　　　　　　　やってるあの番組！？・・・　　　　　　　そうか！　この学園って”でる”こ　　　　とで結構有名だもんな！"
msgstr "Chitose: \"Ghost Crew\"!? The show that's on every summer!?... Of course! This school is pretty famous for being \"haunted\"!"

#. event 0, page 2 | screen 128, cell (17,9)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e000/p2/t00"
msgid "千歳　：青木！　早く行こうぜ！　　　　　　　　　本物の霊撮隊を見るの初めてだぜ！"
msgstr "Chitose: Aoki! Come on, let's go! It's my first time seeing the real Ghost Crew!"

#. event 8, page 2 | screen 128, cell (17,9)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e008/p2/t00"
msgid "千歳　：青木！　早く行こうぜ！　　　　　　　　　本物の霊撮隊を見るの初めてだぜ！"
msgstr "Chitose: Aoki! Come on, let's go! It's my first time seeing the real Ghost Crew!"

#. event 17, page 1 | screen 128, cell (7,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e017/p1/t00"
msgid "生徒　：あ、伊達ちゃん！　　　　　　　　　　　　今ね、テレビ局の人達が取材に　　　　　　来てるよ！　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　私、ちょっと見てこようっと。"
msgstr "Student: Oh, Date! Right now, people from a TV station are here doing a story! I'm going to go take a look."

#. event 18, page 0 | screen 768, cell (11,3)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e018/p0/t00"
msgid "生徒　：ふふ、やってるやってる。　　　　　　　　学長ってマスコミ嫌いだからなぁ。　　　　今年も断るんだろうなぁ。"
msgstr "Student: Heh, there they go. The Principal hates the media. She'll turn them down again this year, I bet."

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t00"
msgid "学長　：取材は、すべてお断りしているはず　　　　ですが？"
msgstr "Principal: I believe we decline all requests for coverage."

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t01"
msgid "取材班：ですから、若月寺の先にある　　　　　　　「根岸霊廟」だけを撮影できれば　　　　　いいんですよ？"
msgstr "TV crew: As I said, all we need is to film the \"Negishi Mausoleum\" beyond Wakatsuki Temple."

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t02"
msgid "学長　：お断りします。お引き取り下さい。"
msgstr "Principal: I refuse. Please leave."

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t03"
msgid "取材班：根岸霊廟に行く道が”なくなって”　　　　いたんです。　霊廟に行くには、　　　　　もう若月寺を通るしか・・・。"
msgstr "TV crew: The road to the Negishi Mausoleum has \"disappeared\". The only way left to reach it is through Wakatsuki Temple..."

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t04"
msgid "学長　：・・・・・お引き取りを。"
msgstr "Principal: .....Please leave."

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t05"
msgid "取材班：あ、そうそう。　校舎の奥の階段、　　　　全面工事中だそうですが・・・以前　　　　事故がありましたよねぇ？"
msgstr "TV crew: Oh, that's right. I hear the staircase at the back of the school is closed for construction... there was an accident a while ago, wasn't there?"

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t06"
msgid "学長　：それが？　どうかしましたか？"
msgstr "Principal: And? What of it?"

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t07"
msgid "取材班：原因不明の落下事故だそうで・・・　　　　死者がでなくて幸いでした。"
msgstr "TV crew: A fall of unknown cause, I'm told... It was fortunate that nobody died."

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t08"
msgid "学長　：・・・それは、同感ですわ。"
