msgstr "Principal: The police have already investigated. (...!) If you wish to look into it yourselves... I will permit you to interview only the students who are at the dormitory."

#. event 21, page 1 | screen 128, cell (9,0)
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "IVENT12/e021/p1/t11"
